  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukrenergo Transmission Network Modernisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The provision of a sovereign-guaranteed loan to the National Energy Company  Ukrenergo (&quot;Ukrenergo&quot; or the &quot;Company&quot;) of up to EUR 149 million, EUR 147.2 of  which has been repurposed into emergency liquidity to support the Company and  ensure stable and uninterrupted electricity transmission services on the entire  territory of Ukraine despite the devastating impact of Russian war on Ukraine  (the &quot;Project&quot;). The EBRD loan is also backed by the EU EFSD guarantee and the  UK Government sovereign donor guarantee.  The Project will safeguard electricity provision and access to vital services  for people and businesses, whose livelihoods and economic security is at  immense risk due to Russian war on Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
